{
	"name": "Get Back",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/daggers/knife-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>When another is wounded, disabled, or compromised, you are able to intervene more rapidly than most. As a reaction to seeing an ally within 10ft reach 0 hit points, become stunned, or get paralyzed, you can move into their square without provoking opportunity attacks. If you do so, your ally gains the benefits of three quarters cover from any and all attacks; full cover if you are at least one size category larger than they are.</p>",
